        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "面倒な手続きが多くて、正直だるい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "週末にわざわざ遠出するのはだるい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「また同じ説明をするのか、怠いな」と彼は小声でぼやいた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
